---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Project status · SwCrypts">
  <h1>Project status</h1>
  <p class="lead">SwCrypts is experimental software. Here is what to expect.</p>

  <section class="notice">
    <h2>Early development</h2>
    <p>
      This project is in its infancy. APIs, CLI flags, configuration formats, and encryption details
      are all subject to breaking changes without warning. Do not use SwCrypts for production data
      without understanding the risks.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Feedback welcome</h2>
    <p>
      Found a bug? Have an idea? The project lives on
      <a href="https://github.com/lafkpages/swcrypts" target="_blank">GitHub</a>. Open an issue or
      pull request — all constructive feedback is appreciated.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Roadmap</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>✅ AES-256-GCM encryption with PBKDF2 key derivation</li>
      <li>✅ Service Worker runtime decryption</li>
      <li>✅ Multi-page and subdirectory support</li>
      <li>🚧 CLI package distribution</li>
      <li>🚧 Custom wrapper themes</li>
      <li>🚧 Tests (we know, we know)</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
